<p>Steering away from the mechanics for a moment, what I want to focus on in this story is more the power dynamic that can arise from three different species trapped on a world where one of them has a distinct advantage [&#8230;]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The large majority of what you have here seems more suited to a tale (which can allow you to use omniscient third person perspective, or first person perspective), unless the researcher makes repeated trips back with a way to record what's happening to him. Otherwise to an outside observer, the guy could have just been teleported somewhere random, had an extremely vivid hallucination, and stumbled back.</p>

